Task: Modify the Bigint implementation to handle negative numbers. 

Your program should define a main() that prints the results of the 
following additions:

   "12345" + "-678910"
   "-12345" + "678910"
   "-111214" + "15683201"

  Also, it should handle the following initialization:

  Bigint a = -47;


pos+pos: "1" + "3"; 

neg+neg: "-1" + "-2"

pos+neg: "1" + "-3";
pos+neg: "3" + "-1";

neg+pos: "-3" + "1";
neg+pos: "-1" + "3";

pos-pos: "1" - "3";

neg-neg: "-1" - "-2"

pos-neg: "1" - "-3";
pos-neg: "3" - "-1";

neg-pos: "-3" - "1";
neg-pos: "-1" - "3";


